1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:02:07,089
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,000
William

3
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,439
Captain Bai.

4
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,400
As of now,

5
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,159
we've screened all hotel guest information.

6
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,080
Nothing suspicious found.

7
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:27,080
Captain Bai, we're in the hotel surveillance system.

8
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,680
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan have entered the lobby.

9
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:40,000
William! William! William!

10
00:03:46,680 --> 00:04:06,000
William! William! William!

11
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,280
About today's press conference,

12
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:12,000
do you have something planned again?

13
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,039
Don't worry, it's all taken care of.

14
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:20,800
I mean...

15
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,839
your own business.

16
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,800
Things you shouldn't know,

17
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,399
don't worry about them.

18
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:49,800
Hello, everyone.

19
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,000
Thank you all for coming to

20
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:53,600
William's press conference.

21
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,360
William's visit to Nanhai this time

22
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,839
is mainly to promote his upcoming book,

23
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,839
"The Triumph of Will."

24
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,959
A while ago,

25
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,800
parts of the book were leaked,

26
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:05,839
sparking strong reactions among readers.

27
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:08,759
While we've heard plenty of praise,

28
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:12,639
we've also faced backlash from internet trolls.

29
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:15,040
Holding this press conference today

30
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,600
isn't to argue with anyone.

31
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,800
We simply want to share William's secret to success

32
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,319
with all of you.

33
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,160
Now, let's invite William

34
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,639
to share his creative journey

35
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,120
with everyone.

36
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,439
Welcome, William!

37
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,759
The target has entered the hotel lobby.

38
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:01,720
Li Qiang has appeared.

39
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:12,000
Wait a second.

40
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,639
Why is he empty-handed?

41
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,959
All units, be advised.

42
00:06:20,199 --> 00:06:21,199
The target has appeared,

43
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:23,000
but he isn't carrying anything.

44
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,480
Detectives, sweep the area immediately.

45
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,879
Check for any other suspicious individuals.

46
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,360
Team A, no suspicious targets found.

47
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,279
Team B, all clear.

48
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,079
Team C, nothing suspicious here.

49
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,560
Expand the search perimeter.

50
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:41,319
Copy that.

51
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:44,759
Attention, everyone.

52
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:48,199
Team A, head toward Spring Department Store behind the hotel.

53
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,519
Copy that, Team A acknowledged.

54
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:54,000
Team B, head east of the hotel,

55
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,040
toward Weisheng Plaza.

56
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:55,680
Team B, copy that.

57
00:06:58,199 --> 00:07:00,199
Team C, head to the parking lot.

58
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,240
If you spot anyone suspicious,

59
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:03,079
report immediately.

60
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,120
Understood?

61
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:04,879
Team C, copy that.

62
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,399
Dongsheng Media

63
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,839
Carnegie once said,

64
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,439
He's here.

65
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:44,319
people don't fail from a lack of conviction,

66
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:45,800
but because they fail to turn that conviction

67
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,399
Boss.

68
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:47,839
into action,

69
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,519
He's arrived.

70
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,360
and see it through to the end.

71
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,920
If you want to succeed,

72
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,079
the prerequisite is

73
00:07:57,040 --> 00:08:00,240
to fuel your passion with desire,

74
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:02,759
level mountains of obstacles with perseverance,

75
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:06,319
and truly believe you will succeed.

76
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:18,040
Li Qiang took a cab here alone.

77
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,480
That means he doesn't want to draw attention.

78
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,800
He probably didn't bring any men.

79
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,120
Captain Bai, on the hotel guest list,

80
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,160
we found no one linked to Li Qiang either.

81
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,600
What's the status on Mu Qing's phone?

82
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,320
What about her bodyguards?

83
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,840
Any suspicious calls?

84
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:36,399
We intercepted 34 calls from her bodyguards.

85
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,759
All regarding the press conference.

86
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:39,360
I asked if any were suspicious.

87
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,679
None.

88
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,240
Last night, Mu Qing had Xu Duoduo

89
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,879
deliver a new phone to Li Qiang.

90
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:46,720
This proves

91
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,679
she's very alert to wiretaps.

92
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,840
So for today's deal,

93
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,120
she will definitely use a new number.

94
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,240
Ten minutes left.

95
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,879
The press conference will be over soon.

96
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,720
Should the teams move in?

97
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,200
If we can't catch them red-handed with the goods,

98
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,279
arresting the suspects is useless.

99
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:15,440
He Bo,

100
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,840
recheck the hotel guest registry.

101
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:18,919
Understood.

102
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:19,399
Xiao Wei,

103
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,879
pull up all surveillance footage

104
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,240
from the lobby today.

105
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:22,639
Yes, sir.

106
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:26,600
Zhuang Yan, keep your eyes on Li Qiang.

107
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,559
It's all nonsense.

108
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:38,759
Hold on.

109
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,559
Zoom in.

110
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,320
Captain Bai, I found something.

111
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,440
Last night, a room was booked

112
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:51,200
by Li Yawei's girlfriend, Chen Ran.

113
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:51,840
Room number?

114
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:53,120
Building One, 9999.

115
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:53,639
Xiao Ding.

116
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,200
Copy that.

117
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,679
The target is on the move.

118
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:19,360
What's the situation?

119
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,360
They tampered with the surveillance in Building 1.

120
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,120
Give me another 30 seconds.

121
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,799
Zhuang Yan, Ge Dan.

122
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:28,240
Leave the conference hall immediately.

123
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,919
Head to Room 9999 in Building 1

124
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,879
and set up surveillance.

125
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,000
All set.

126
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,159
There were rumors online earlier

127
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:50,519
that Mr. William Han

128
00:10:50,559 --> 00:10:52,799
has been dating your boss, Ms. Mu Qing.

129
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,039
Is that true?

130
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:03,679
That's right.

131
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,559
Mu Qing and I

132
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,480
were indeed in a relationship before.

133
00:11:13,159 --> 00:11:14,120
A relationship?

134
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:23,759
In both my life and my career,

135
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:25,240
Mu Qing has helped me tremendously.

136
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,240
I'm deeply grateful to her.

137
00:11:32,039 --> 00:11:32,759
But...

138
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:34,960
...I've come to realize

139
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,360
that between us,

140
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:42,679
we can appreciate each other,

141
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,399
but we can't truly be together.

142
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,679
My contract with Mu Qing's team

143
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:59,240
ends at the end of this month.

144
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,559
I'd like to announce here

145
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,759
that when the time comes,

146
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,440
I will end further collaboration with Mu Qing.

147
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:16,240
End the collaboration?

148
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,080
Why?

149
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:21,879
Mr. William Han,

150
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:23,279
which agency will you sign with next?

151
00:12:24,039 --> 00:12:26,120
Mr. William Han, why terminate the contract?

152
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,000
Was it because of any unpleasantness

153
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,120
regarding your contract?

154
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,639
Ending our collaboration

155
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,360
is entirely for personal reasons.

156
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,279
All I can say is

157
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,320
I can't fully align with the vision of Mu Qing's team.

158
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:52,000
Thank you, everyone.

159
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,639
Mr. William Han!

160
00:12:58,679 --> 00:13:00,440
Ms. Mu Qing, do you have any response?

161
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,799
I'm sorry,

162
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,480
this came very suddenly.

163
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:06,679
No comment.

164
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,240
Please answer these two questions, Ms. Mu Qing.

165
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:38,039
Ma'am, I'm so sorry.

166
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:38,840
Here, let me help. Let me help you.

167
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,720
It's okay, it's fine.

168
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:41,919
I'm really so sorry.

169
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,559
I was in a rush.

170
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,799
Ma'am, your room key.

171
00:14:01,399 --> 00:14:01,840
Thank you.

172
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,039
Here, let me help you.

173
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:07,919
Sorry about that, ma'am.

174
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:09,720
It's fine, no worries.

175
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,639
Mu Qing is about to reach the ninth floor.

176
00:14:29,799 --> 00:14:30,759
Zhuang Yan, stop her.

177
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,039
Excuse me, ma'am.

178
00:14:41,039 --> 00:14:42,120
I'm a reporter with the Nanhai Times.

179
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:42,879
I'd like to ask you,

180
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,399
regarding what William Han said today,

181
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,519
do you have any response?

182
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:49,399
I wanted him to do better.

183
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,440
Then why did he end his partnership with you?

184
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,759
I once had a dog.

185
00:14:56,039 --> 00:14:57,200
It was always very loyal to me.

186
00:14:57,679 --> 00:15:00,039
Then one day, it suddenly wanted to leave.

187
00:15:01,559 --> 00:15:02,799
I don't know, before it left,

188
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:04,600
what it was thinking.

189
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,159
Are you comparing William Han to that?

190
00:15:06,159 --> 00:15:06,879
The event is already over.

191
00:15:07,039 --> 00:15:08,519
Ms. Mu Qing will not answer any questions.

192
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:37,840
We had a deal,

193
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,120
yet you show up empty-handed.

194
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:42,960
What's that supposed to mean?

195
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,720
The goods are already here.

196
00:16:46,519 --> 00:16:47,960
You just haven't seen them yet.

197
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:55,600
Here's a sample.

198
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,120
The latest version.

199
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,440
It's 99 percent pure.

200
00:17:00,559 --> 00:17:02,000
I'm confident that on the market,

201
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,200
there is nothing better.

202
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,319
The money's here.

203
00:17:37,559 --> 00:17:39,480
Do you want to check the money first,

204
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,720
or let me see the goods first?

205
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,279
If I don't see the goods in one minute,

206
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,480
don't even think about walking out of here.

207
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,680
The suspect is armed.

208
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,880
Detectives, evacuate all bystanders immediately.

209
00:18:21,039 --> 00:18:22,039
The deal is about to go down.

210
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,559
All units, get into position.

211
00:18:23,839 --> 00:18:24,720
Stand by for the takedown order.

212
00:18:26,279 --> 00:18:26,640
Copy that.

213
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,319
All units, monitor the scene closely.

214
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:33,480
Be ready to evacuate the crowd at any moment

215
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:34,519
and assist with the takedown.

216
00:18:38,839 --> 00:18:40,160
That's very dangerous.

217
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,440
I've already given you the goods.

218
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,240
What game are you playing?

219
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,799
Could you please call the front desk

220
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,119
and have them bring up your package?

221
00:18:51,759 --> 00:18:53,880
The recipient's number is this phone number.

222
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:55,759
This is yours.

223
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:04,799
Monitor the hotel's internal lines.

224
00:19:05,079 --> 00:19:05,359
Yes, sir.

225
00:19:17,519 --> 00:19:18,480
Hello. Here's your room key.

226
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:19,640
Thanks.

227
00:19:22,839 --> 00:19:24,440
Hello, front desk.

228
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,640
How may I help you?

229
00:19:26,319 --> 00:19:26,960
Hello.

230
00:19:27,799 --> 00:19:30,720
I'm the guest in Room 9999.

231
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,039
Is there a package for me at the front desk?

232
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,200
Yes, there is.

233
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:35,680
Could you confirm your phone number?

234
00:19:36,519 --> 00:19:40,920
142 6128 5517

235
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:42,039
All right.

236
00:19:42,079 --> 00:19:43,640
I'll have someone bring it up right away.

237
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,119
Okay?

238
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:45,759
Thank you.

239
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:57,680
The suspicious item

240
00:19:57,799 --> 00:19:59,759
is being taken to the deal site by a staff member.

241
00:20:00,079 --> 00:20:00,880
Zhuang Yan, Ge Dan,

242
00:20:01,079 --> 00:20:01,759
you two take over.

243
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:03,279
Copy that.

244
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:04,559
Captain Bai,

245
00:20:05,359 --> 00:20:07,000
I'll take He Bo down to back up CID.

246
00:20:07,119 --> 00:20:07,559
All right.

247
00:20:10,119 --> 00:20:10,839
Mu Qing and I,

248
00:20:12,359 --> 00:20:13,640
although in our career paths

249
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,880
we didn't always see eye to eye,

250
00:20:16,359 --> 00:20:18,079
I can still be 100 percent sure

251
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,640
that she's a wonderful person.

252
00:20:23,039 --> 00:20:24,200
I wish her all the best.

253
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,880
That's all I have to say.

254
00:20:27,319 --> 00:20:27,960
Thank you, everyone.

255
00:20:28,039 --> 00:20:29,160
Thank you. Thank you, everyone.

256
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:29,799
Excuse me.

257
00:20:32,079 --> 00:20:34,119
Captain Shen, have your team evacuate the crowd.

258
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,039
Keep it as low-key as possible.

259
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,240
Copy.

260
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,599
All CID units,

261
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:40,119
begin evacuating the crowd now.

262
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,839
Try not to cause a panic.

263
00:20:46,839 --> 00:20:47,440
Hello, police.

264
00:20:47,759 --> 00:20:48,799
Please cooperate with us.

265
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,000
Thank you.

266
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,039
Excuse me.

267
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:05,160
Please cooperate and leave immediately.

268
00:21:05,559 --> 00:21:05,920
Thank you.

269
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,240
Quickly, move, move!

270
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,960
Hello, here's your package.

271
00:21:33,119 --> 00:21:33,480
Thank you.

272
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:19,240
Working with Miss Mu Qing

273
00:22:20,319 --> 00:22:21,440
has been quite interesting.

274
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:24,640
I hope we can work together more.

275
00:22:35,839 --> 00:22:36,319
Move in.

276
00:22:40,319 --> 00:22:41,160
Freeze! Police!

277
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,799
You're suspected of major drug trafficking.

278
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:52,559
Don't move!

279
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,680
I'll remember you.

280
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:15,440
Thank you.

281
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:18,119
Though I'll forget you soon enough.

282
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:19,759
Take him away.

283
00:23:25,559 --> 00:23:28,880
Captain, all suspects are in custody.

284
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:58,839
Take him away.

285
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:04,440
Move.

286
00:24:05,079 --> 00:24:05,359
Move it.

287
00:24:39,839 --> 00:24:41,079
Tend to the injured first. Secure the scene.

288
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:51,559
Drive.

289
00:25:02,359 --> 00:25:03,000
Go!

290
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:07,279
Get off me!

291
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:08,160
Let go!

292
00:25:08,240 --> 00:25:09,759
Get out of the car! Get out!

293
00:25:10,599 --> 00:25:11,000
Let go!

294
00:25:18,680 --> 00:25:19,160
Get in!

295
00:25:31,799 --> 00:25:32,160
Go!

296
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:33,799
All units, be advised.

297
00:25:34,119 --> 00:25:34,720
All units, be advised.

298
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,440
This is Shen Cheng from Criminal Investigation.

299
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:39,000
Three armed suspects

300
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:41,400
fleeing in a black Honda sedan,

301
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:44,000
license plate Nan A-7C422.

302
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,599
Nan A-7C422.

303
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:47,079
Prepare to intercept immediately.

304
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:51,599
They're right on our tail.

305
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,839
Brother Qiang, hang on tight!

306
00:26:14,599 --> 00:26:14,920
Hold on!

307
00:26:45,559 --> 00:26:46,400
Suspect vehicle

308
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:48,119
is heading toward middle Jincheng Avenue,

309
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:49,559
about to pass the Shangcheng Street intersection.

310
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:09,839
All units, be advised.

311
00:27:10,119 --> 00:27:11,000
We're on Shangcheng Avenue.

312
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:13,000
The suspect vehicle is about to clear Dongfeng Bridge,

313
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:13,759
entering Nanjing Road.

314
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,279
All units, prepare to intercept.

315
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:39,880
Stop the car!

316
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:41,960
Watch out!

317
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:41,720
Turn left.

318
00:29:09,559 --> 00:29:11,200
Brother Qiang, you guys go first.

319
00:29:12,359 --> 00:29:12,920
Ah Wei!

320
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:14,680
Hurry, go!

321
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:17,480
Brother, take care!

322
00:29:18,039 --> 00:29:18,480
Let's go!

323
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,759
Later on, send Ah Wei's family

324
00:30:44,599 --> 00:30:45,400
some money.

325
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:15,200
Vehicle ahead, you're surrounded!

326
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:18,079
Pull over immediately! Pull over immediately!

327
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,240
Listen up inside!

328
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:45,839
Drop your weapons and surrender now!

329
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,119
Move in!

330
00:32:26,559 --> 00:32:27,920
All units, be advised. All units, be advised.

331
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,519
Suspect Li Qiang has escaped.

332
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:31,519
Guan Qiang, get to the parking lot immediately

333
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:32,279
and pull the surveillance footage.

334
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:48,799
Chief Wei.

335
00:32:49,079 --> 00:32:49,559
Captain Bai.

336
00:32:49,839 --> 00:32:50,680
After the suspect vehicle

337
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:52,440
left the Jinye Building parking lot,

338
00:32:52,559 --> 00:32:54,200
three cars drove out in succession.

339
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:55,839
I'll have the Traffic Command Center

340
00:32:55,839 --> 00:32:57,039
patch into your radio comms

341
00:32:57,279 --> 00:32:59,039
to give real-time updates on all three cars.

342
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,880
Please have them patch into three channels.

343
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:02,519
We'll split into three teams to pursue the suspects.

344
00:33:02,759 --> 00:33:03,200
I'll arrange it.

345
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:16,839
A black Volvo, plate Nan A49870,

346
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:18,480
has entered Section Three of Chenglong Avenue.

347
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:21,240
The suspect's license plate

348
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,640
also seems to start with "Nan."

349
00:33:24,119 --> 00:33:25,039
Chenglong Avenue?

350
00:33:25,680 --> 00:33:26,279
If he's on the run,

351
00:33:26,279 --> 00:33:27,519
why head toward a crowded area?

352
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:32,680
Tian Xin's place is near Chenglong Avenue too.

353
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:35,559
Could he be going after Xu Duoduo?

354
00:33:36,079 --> 00:33:36,880
Right now, though,

355
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:38,440
Li Qiang doesn't know we're watching him.

356
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,559
Besides, the man's a desperate outlaw.

357
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:42,079
That's absolutely right.

358
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:51,839
Copy that.

359
00:33:52,960 --> 00:33:53,640
Keep tracking him.

360
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:54,920
Don't let Li Qiang get away!

361
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:06,039
Captain Bai,

362
00:34:06,599 --> 00:34:07,519
detain Xu Duoduo immediately.

363
00:34:07,839 --> 00:34:08,760
Li Qiang is very likely

364
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:09,840
on his way to find him.

365
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:10,719
Copy that.

366
00:34:11,119 --> 00:34:11,440
Move.

367
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,199
No.

368
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:19,880
I just did a little business

369
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:21,000
and made some cash, you know?

370
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,719
Why would I lie to you?

371
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:25,960
I'm just flaunting my cash.

372
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,920
William Han's unusual behavior

373
00:34:29,159 --> 00:34:29,960
Let me tell you,

374
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:33,719
your boy has struck it rich now.

375
00:34:35,159 --> 00:34:38,079
Here is the suspect information from police:

376
00:34:38,599 --> 00:34:40,079
Li Qiang, male, 35 years old,

377
00:34:40,320 --> 00:34:41,320
182 centimeters tall,

378
00:34:41,559 --> 00:34:42,960
armed with a firearm.

379
00:34:43,199 --> 00:34:45,559
If any citizen spots the suspect,

380
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,920
please notify the police immediately.

381
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:50,880
Citizens who provide valuable information

382
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:51,800
will be rewarded by police.

383
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:54,119
Meanwhile, police also remind the public

384
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,840
that upon spotting the suspect,

385
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,480
do not take any action

386
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,920
that could endanger personal safety.

387
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:31,079
Who is it?

388
00:35:31,719 --> 00:35:32,760
We're from property management.

389
00:35:33,039 --> 00:35:34,079
Please open the door.

390
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:40,840
Uh, just a moment. Coming!

391
00:35:48,559 --> 00:35:49,280
Please hurry up.

392
00:35:49,679 --> 00:35:50,719
We still have the next unit to check.

393
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:02,920
Stop! Don't run!

394
00:36:05,239 --> 00:36:05,639
Go!

395
00:36:27,159 --> 00:36:28,119
Police! Don't move!

396
00:36:28,199 --> 00:36:29,360
Stop! Stop!

397
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:00,960
Brother Qiang!

398
00:37:02,599 --> 00:37:03,440
Stop! Don't run!

399
00:37:03,840 --> 00:37:04,400
Get in!

400
00:37:19,079 --> 00:37:19,519
Talk.

401
00:37:19,639 --> 00:37:21,400
Li Qiang and his accomplice took Xu Duoduo.

402
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:23,639
The suspect is driving a Mercedes SUV,

403
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:24,960
just pulled out of Xingyuan Street.

404
00:37:25,079 --> 00:37:26,119
Sky Net is syncing

405
00:37:26,119 --> 00:37:27,360
the suspect vehicle's info to us.

406
00:37:27,599 --> 00:37:28,559
Switch to Channel 3.

407
00:37:28,639 --> 00:37:29,079
Copy that.

408
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,320
Let's go.

409
00:37:33,079 --> 00:37:33,679
All units, be advised.

410
00:37:33,880 --> 00:37:35,000
Suspect vehicle confirmed:

411
00:37:35,079 --> 00:37:36,679
a black Mercedes SUV,

412
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:38,639
license plate Nan A49870,

413
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,360
just left Xingyuan Street.

414
00:37:40,519 --> 00:37:42,000
All units stand by for Sky Net updates.

415
00:37:46,599 --> 00:37:47,039
Brother Qiang...

416
00:37:49,719 --> 00:37:50,119
Brother Qiang!

417
00:37:51,199 --> 00:37:51,639
Don't shoot!

418
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,400
I... I don't know anything!

419
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,840
The only ones who knew about the deal

420
00:37:55,159 --> 00:37:56,400
were you and your crew.

421
00:37:57,239 --> 00:37:59,159
You know damn well what you did.

422
00:37:59,679 --> 00:38:01,719
Brother Qiang, I really don't know anything!

423
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,280
You really know nothing?

424
00:38:04,079 --> 00:38:05,440
One of my brothers is dead.

425
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:07,559
If you don't tell me something useful,

426
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,000
I'll send you down to join him right now.

427
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:09,800
No, please, don't!

428
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:14,400
Suspect vehicle...

429
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:15,280
Brother Qiang!

430
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:16,440
Head that way!

431
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:26,039
We're on Shuiwen Alley off Dazhou Road,

432
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:26,800
pursuing the suspect.

433
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:28,199
Send backup to intercept immediately!

434
00:38:32,519 --> 00:38:33,679
Are you their informant?

435
00:38:34,199 --> 00:38:35,320
I'm not!

436
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,840
I really don't know!

437
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:39,639
It wasn't me!

438
00:38:40,199 --> 00:38:40,679
Get up.

439
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:51,159
Keep your mouth shut,

440
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:53,239
and I'll blow your head off.

441
00:38:55,079 --> 00:38:56,559
I'll talk! I'll talk, I'll talk!

442
00:38:56,559 --> 00:38:57,119
Talk.

443
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:59,280
The police bugged my place!

444
00:39:02,119 --> 00:39:03,719
But I don't know when they planted it!

445
00:39:03,719 --> 00:39:04,920
It's not my fault, Brother Qiang!

446
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:06,840
Who else came looking for you lately?

447
00:39:07,239 --> 00:39:08,679
No one! Nobody came looking for me!

448
00:39:09,239 --> 00:39:10,400
Only you came!

449
00:39:10,719 --> 00:39:12,280
I'm usually the one who goes to see people!

450
00:39:13,159 --> 00:39:14,840
Wait, I remember!

451
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:15,960
The woman next door...

452
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:17,360
She came over to my place!

453
00:39:17,639 --> 00:39:19,079
She must be spying on us, Brother Qiang!

454
00:39:20,079 --> 00:39:20,320
I...

455
00:39:20,639 --> 00:39:21,920
It's really not my fault, Brother Qiang!

456
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,519
Don't kill me!

457
00:39:24,039 --> 00:39:25,039
I won't kill you.

458
00:39:29,159 --> 00:39:29,880
I'm not gonna kill you.

459
00:39:30,159 --> 00:39:31,559
You're still useful to me.

460
00:39:34,599 --> 00:39:35,960
Go block that car for me.

461
00:39:58,519 --> 00:39:59,599
Li Qiang is fleeing toward Sanli Street.

462
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:00,840
There's a hostage on the scene.

463
00:40:01,079 --> 00:40:01,840
Send additional ambulances.

464
00:40:13,559 --> 00:40:14,360
What did Li Qiang tell you?

465
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:16,079
You know where their hideout is.

466
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,440
The situation is critical.

467
00:40:17,599 --> 00:40:18,800
Please don't interfere with our work.

468
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,480
Is there anything else you want to tell me?

469
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,119
Do you have something to say to me?

470
00:40:23,119 --> 00:40:23,880
Tian Xin.

471
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:25,360
What?

472
00:40:26,079 --> 00:40:27,400
Tian Xin!

473
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:28,119
Hurry up! Quick!

474
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:30,280
Tian Xin!

475
00:40:45,519 --> 00:40:47,000
Suspect vehicle spotted at Dongfang Plaza.

476
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,039
You are surrounded!

477
00:41:08,039 --> 00:41:08,760
Drop your weapons!

478
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:10,199
Exit the vehicle and surrender immediately!

479
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:52,639
How many days has Mu Qing been here in total?

480
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:54,039
Besides Li Qiang,

481
00:41:54,039 --> 00:41:55,800
has she contacted any other sellers?

482
00:41:57,360 --> 00:41:59,400
Exactly one week as of today.

483
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:01,320
From the intel we've gathered,

484
00:42:01,519 --> 00:42:02,800
before Li Qiang,

485
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:05,840
she contacted Li Yawei, nicknamed Elvis.

486
00:42:06,199 --> 00:42:07,719
But whether Li Yawei provided her

487
00:42:07,719 --> 00:42:09,239
with a drug-trafficking channel,

488
00:42:09,400 --> 00:42:10,719
we're still not sure.

489
00:42:12,679 --> 00:42:15,880
Previously, regarding Xu Duoduo and Li Yawei,

490
00:42:16,079 --> 00:42:18,679
we were tracking and monitoring them.

491
00:42:19,519 --> 00:42:21,239
But Xu Duoduo is now in the hospital,

492
00:42:21,239 --> 00:42:22,039
comatose with severe injuries.

493
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:23,519
Officers from Criminal Investigation

494
00:42:23,519 --> 00:42:25,400
are helping us arrest Li Yawei.

495
00:42:27,039 --> 00:42:29,239
Because Li Qiang took precautions

496
00:42:29,519 --> 00:42:31,079
for today's deal,

497
00:42:31,280 --> 00:42:34,400
combined with his sharp counter-surveillance skills,

498
00:42:34,639 --> 00:42:36,840
he managed to slip away twice.

499
00:42:37,119 --> 00:42:38,320
So I'd like to request

500
00:42:38,679 --> 00:42:42,159
a citywide manhunt for Li Qiang and his accomplices.

501
00:42:42,719 --> 00:42:43,119
Approved.

502
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,360
Get traffic police to cooperate too,

503
00:42:45,599 --> 00:42:47,239
tightly monitoring all major roads

504
00:42:47,519 --> 00:42:49,840
to strictly prevent Li Qiang and his gang from fleeing Nanhai.

505
00:42:52,199 --> 00:42:54,119
Step up the interrogation of the suspects

506
00:42:54,360 --> 00:42:56,519
to establish the crimes of Mu Qing's gang.

507
00:42:57,280 --> 00:42:57,679
Understood.

508
00:42:59,519 --> 00:43:01,679
As several major cases surface,

509
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:03,440
the burden on your shoulders will get heavier.

510
00:43:03,599 --> 00:43:06,079
Also, speed up the logistics company case.

511
00:43:07,239 --> 00:43:07,639
Understood.

512
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:13,199
The hospital called.

513
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:15,880
Captain Bai.

514
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:19,159
Xu Duoduo just succumbed to his injuries.

515
00:43:20,119 --> 00:43:21,360
And the fact that he was wiretapped

516
00:43:21,639 --> 00:43:22,599
was likely discovered by Li Qiang.

517
00:43:22,679 --> 00:43:23,519
How can you be sure?

518
00:43:24,039 --> 00:43:25,760
Earlier, I asked him if he had anything to say to me,

519
00:43:25,960 --> 00:43:27,000
and he only mentioned Tian Xin.

520
00:43:27,599 --> 00:43:28,119
Got it.

521
00:43:30,679 --> 00:43:32,159
Xu Duoduo succumbed to his injuries.

522
00:43:32,480 --> 00:43:35,320
Also, before he died, he only mentioned Tian Xin.

523
00:43:35,880 --> 00:43:36,639
Tian Xin?
